  "classes/Watcher.md": "# Class: \`Watcher\`\\n\\n<!-- YAML\\ntitle: \\"Class: Watcher\\"\\nsource_link: index.ts#L57\\n-->\\n\\n- Extends: {EventEmitter<WatcherEvents>}\\n\\nWatches files and rebuilds.\\n\\n## Event: \`'done'\`\\n\\n<!-- YAML\\nsource_link: index.ts#L46\\n-->\\n\\n- \`duration\` {number}\\n\\nA build finished.\\n\\n## Event: \`'error'\`\\n\\n<!-- YAML\\nsource_link: index.ts#L48\\n-->\\n\\n- \`error\` {Error}\\n- \`details\` {Object}\\n  - \`file\` {string}\\n\\nA build failed.\\n\\n<div id=\\"constructor\\"></div>\\n\\n## \`new Watcher()\`\\n\\n- Returns: {Watcher}\\n\\n<div id=\\"running\\"></div>\\n\\n## \`watcher.running\`\\n\\n<!-- YAML\\nsource_link: index.ts#L59\\n-->\\n\\n- Type: {boolean}\\n\\nWhether it is watching.\\n\\n<div id=\\"close\\"></div>\\n\\n## \`watcher.close([force])\`\\n\\n<!-- YAML\\nsource_link: index.ts#L69\\n-->\\n\\n- \`force\` {boolean} Whether to stop running builds too.\\n- Returns: {boolean} Whether it was watching.\\n\\nStops watching.\\n\\n<div id=\\"create\\"></div>\\n\\n## Static method: \`Watcher.create()\`\\n\\n<!-- YAML\\nsource_link: index.ts#L74\\n-->\\n\\n- Returns: {Watcher}\\n\\nWatches with the default options.\\n",
