  "interfaces/Server.md": "# Interface: Server\\n\\n<!-- YAML\\ntitle: \\"Interface: Server\\"\\nsource_link: index.ts#L152\\n-->\\n\\nServes the output, emitting the events of [ServerEvents](ServerEvents.md).\\n\\n## Event: \`'connect'\`\\n\\n<!-- YAML\\nsource_link: index.ts#L146\\n-->\\n\\n- \`id\` {string}\\n\\nA client connected.\\n\\n<div id=\\"on\\"></div>\\n\\n## \`server.on(event, listener)\`\\n\\n<!-- YAML\\nsource_link: index.ts#L159\\n-->\\n\\n- \`event\` {\\"connect\\"} The event.\\n- \`listener\` {(args: ServerEvents[E]) => void} Called with the arguments of the event.\\n- Returns: {this}\\n\\nListens to an event.\\n",
